      output is written to output.txt in the Downloads folder. The input type is byte,
      so the block stores the recovered data as raw byte data. Since unbuffered mode
      is enabled, the data is written to the file immediately. The overwrite option
      means the old file content is replaced each time the flowgraph starts.
    file: C:\Users\musta\Downloads\output.txt
